## StickyNote

**Namespace:** `Cyrena.Coding.Models`
**Assembly:** `Cyrena.Coding.Core`

### Purpose
Simple entity for the AI to persist notes about the project. Stored via `IStore<StickyNote>`.

### Class Definition

```csharp
public sealed class StickyNote : Entity
{
    public StickyNote() { }
    public StickyNote(string? title, string? content)
    {
        Id = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();
        Title = title;
        Content = content;
    }
    public string? Title { get; set; }
    public string? Content { get; set; }
}
```

### Storage
Registered in `DeveloperAssistantMode.ConfigureAsync`:
```csharp
persistence.AddSingletonStore<StickyNote>("sticky_notes");
```

### AI Access
Exposed via `ProjectInformation` Semantic Kernel plugin:
- `get_plan` — Returns `DevelopPlanAIModel` including notes
- `create_note` — Creates new note
- `update_note` — Updates existing note
- `delete_note` — Deletes note
